{"id":"n47020-1-7","stage":4,"title":"대원 · 队员","scene":"人物与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n47020-1-7-1","ko":"제가 산에서 길을 잃었어요. 도와주세요.","zh":"我在山上迷路了，请帮帮我。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"제가","meaning":"我","explanation":"저：我；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"저","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44506","senseId":"1","lemma":"저","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"제가","audio":"/audio/c1f551b0d681d02645e2.mp3"}},{"text":"산에서","meaning":"山","explanation":"산：山；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"산","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"20954","senseId":"1","lemma":"산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"산에서","audio":"/audio/57b9db1c5d79d274bf8e.mp3"}},{"text":"길을","meaning":"路上","explanation":"길：路上；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"길","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"59251","senseId":"9","lemma":"길","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"길을","audio":"/audio/a41fdccc5780433c53cc.mp3"}},{"text":"잃었어요.","meaning":"迷失","explanation":"잃다：迷失；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"잃다","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17177","senseId":"9","lemma":"잃다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잃었어요","audio":"/audio/f67991ff4435c73ba0dd.mp3"}},{"text":"도와주세요.","meaning":"帮忙，帮助","explanation":"도와주다：帮忙，帮助；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"도와주다","audio":"/audio/1505f995680e9a46c72c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70744","senseId":"1","lemma":"도와주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"도와주세요","audio":"/audio/1dbd1db7e2427222fde8.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"ac0e9ef613fd92c8","term":"저","zh":"我","audio":"/audio/ac0e9ef613fd92c84845.mp3","entryId":"44506","definition":"说话人在听话人面前对自己的谦称。","pronunciation":["저"]},{"id":"ab367eb9a60ab986","term":"산","zh":"山","audio":"/audio/ab367eb9a60ab986cced.mp3","entryId":"20954","definition":"比平地高耸出很多，大多有着树木、草、石头等的土地。","pronunciation":["산"]},{"id":"d72c843458543667","term":"길","zh":"路上","audio":"/audio/d72c8434585436678000.mp3","entryId":"59251","definition":"移向某处的途中。","pronunciation":["길"]},{"id":"03ebbd29f2834d52","term":"잃다","zh":"迷失","audio":"/audio/03ebbd29f2834d52089e.mp3","entryId":"17177","definition":"失去方向或迷路。","pronunciation":["일타"]},{"id":"1505f995680e9a46","term":"도와주다","zh":"帮忙，帮助","audio":"/audio/1505f995680e9a46c72c.mp3","entryId":"70744","definition":"帮别人做事或助人一臂之力。","pronunciation":["도와주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/e51622051badc94c3c60.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n47020-1-7-2","ko":"지금 구조대 대원들이 가고 있으니 조금만 기다리세요.","zh":"救援人员正在赶来，您稍等一会儿吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在，这会儿","explanation":"지금：现在，这会儿。","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62523","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}},{"text":"구조대","meaning":"救护队","explanation":"구조대：救护队。","readings":[{"term":"구조대","audio":"/audio/ca878a3210f40904b46a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36924","senseId":"1","lemma":"구조대","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"구조대","audio":"/audio/ca878a3210f40904b46a.mp3"}},{"text":"대원들이","meaning":"队员","explanation":"대원：队员；들：复数后缀，表示多个对象；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"대원","audio":"/audio/d4a08aa00df5f9e3d891.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"47020","senseId":"1","lemma":"대원","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"대원들이","audio":"/audio/10c17296ef88ffe469d9.mp3"}},{"text":"가고","meaning":"去","explanation":"가다：去；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"가다","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27500","senseId":"1","lemma":"가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"가고","audio":"/audio/1fb46b7cd8a51290e6be.mp3"}},{"text":"있으니","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；으니：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"있으니","audio":"/audio/ef60efcf38deedc61094.mp3"}},{"text":"조금만","meaning":"片刻，一会儿","explanation":"조금：片刻，一会儿；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"조금","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61176","senseId":"2","lemma":"조금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"조금만","audio":"/audio/61e4375f0847dd284eb0.mp3"}},{"text":"기다리세요.","meaning":"等，等待","explanation":"기다리다：等，等待；세요：包含尊敬形式的礼貌句末，可表示请求、劝告或询问等。","readings":[{"term":"기다리다","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62264","senseId":"1","lemma":"기다리다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"기다리세요","audio":"/audio/1fb1acbf49005a5dd33c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在，这会儿","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62523","definition":"在说话的当时；或此时此刻。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"ca878a3210f40904","term":"구조대","zh":"救护队","audio":"/audio/ca878a3210f40904b46a.mp3","entryId":"36924","definition":"具备一定的装备，救助处于危险中的人或物品的组织或人。","pronunciation":["구ː조대"]},{"id":"d4a08aa00df5f9e3","term":"대원","zh":"队员","audio":"/audio/d4a08aa00df5f9e3d891.mp3","entryId":"47020","definition":"属于部队或集体的人。","pronunciation":["대원"]},{"id":"233cb510410b09d6","term":"가다","zh":"去","audio":"/audio/233cb510410b09d69cdc.mp3","entryId":"27500","definition":"从一个地方移动到另一个地方。","pronunciation":["가다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"b4049b7414b62d9b","term":"조금","zh":"片刻，一会儿","audio":"/audio/b4049b7414b62d9bee5d.mp3","entryId":"61176","definition":"短暂时间。","pronunciation":["조금"]},{"id":"1f9765247406d52d","term":"기다리다","zh":"等，等待","audio":"/audio/1f9765247406d52d5aaa.mp3","entryId":"62264","definition":"直到人、时机到来或某事完成为止，一直打发时间。","pronunciation":["기다리다"]}],"audio":"/audio/d7345b688318da1708e1.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.082,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=47020","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"고급","day":147,"sequenceScore":2.9087,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["救援人员正在赶来，您稍等一会儿吧。","我比较瘦，而我们哥哥则有点胖。","我在山上迷路了，请帮帮我。"],"answer":2},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["救援人员正在赶来，您稍等一会儿吧。","我在山上迷路了，请帮帮我。","我比较瘦，而我们哥哥则有点胖。"],"answer":0}]}
